# Service endpoints baked into production builds.
#
# The game is served from Cloudflare Pages (robot-mech.pages.dev). Pages can host
# neither a Durable Object (a DO class must be defined in a Worker) nor the D1-backed
# pilot-account API, so both stay on the veyra-prime Worker and the client reaches
# them cross-origin.
#
# WebSockets are not subject to CORS preflight and the Worker performs no Origin
# check, so the match socket connects directly. The account API DOES enforce an
# Origin allowlist and answers preflights — see server/accountapi.mjs.
#
# Leave either unset to fall back to same-origin (/ws, /api), which is what you want
# if the game is ever served from the Worker itself again.
VITE_MP_URL=wss://veyra-prime.seesianga.workers.dev/ws
VITE_API_URL=https://veyra-prime.seesianga.workers.dev/api
